# Consulted by `lingfu publish` (its tarball builder isn't .gitignore-aware
# at all -- it walks the real filesystem). x.wav/y.wav are 174MB/99MB local
# background-audio assets, already excluded from git via the repo-root
# .gitignore; this keeps them out of a publish upload too, even if they're
# sitting in this folder locally when `lingfu publish` runs.
x.wav
y.wav
